		{"id":"df428b3e99d74078","type":"text","text":"## Source-of-truth rule\nThe Platform database is authoritative for **product state**: who owns the project, what was submitted, what the user sees, annotations, imported result summaries and authorized artifact references.\n\nThe Engine is authoritative for **scientific execution metadata and raw scientific outputs** until those outputs are imported and registered by the Platform.","x":-930,"y":1370,"width":2570,"height":210},
